<title>USA: AlliedSignal Inc Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>AlliedSignal Inc Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>MORRIS TOWNSHIP, N.J. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.90		    $0.77</p>
<p> Net			253,000		  217,000</p>
<p> Sales		  3,348,000		3,499,000</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.62		    $2.26</p>
<p> Net			741,000		  642,000</p>
<p> Sales		     10,473		   10,548</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Results from nine months ended September 1996 were adjusted to exclude a one-time, after-tax gain of $368 million, or $1.30 per share, for the sale of its hydraulic braking and anti-lock braking systems business effective April 1, 1996, as well as the effect of repositioning and other charges.</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate for Q3 was $0.90 per share</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
